<title>SWEDEN: Swedish retail sales rose 8.5 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Swedish retail sales rose 8.5 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail sales rose 8.5 percent in March compared to March 1996, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>SWEDISH RETAIL SALES</p>
<p>    (Percentage change)	  March 97    year-to-date</p>
<p>					   +8.5	 +3.8</p>
<p>    - in non-specialised stores  +4.5	 +1.5</p>
<p>    - in specialised stores     +14.0	 +6.9</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
